{"speciesId":731,"names":{"fr":"Picassaut","es":"Pikipek","en":"Pikipek","ja":"ツツケラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il creuse les arbres à raison de seize coups de bec par seconde. Le trou creusé lui sert ensuite à stocker des provisions ou à faire son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Hace agujeros en los árboles a una velocidad de 16 picotazos por segundo y los utiliza como despensa o como su nido."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can peck at a rate of 16 times a second to drill holes in trees. It uses the holes for food storage and for nesting."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"秒間１６連打 で 木を 突き 穴を ほる。 開けた 穴は 餌を 仕舞う 貯蔵庫や 巣に 使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se nourrit essentiellement de fruits, dont il conserve les pépins dans son bec pour en canarder ses ennemis, telle une mitraillette."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Las bayas constituyen su principal alimento. Usa las pepitas de las mismas a modo de proyectiles para atacar expulsándolas por su pico."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon feeds on berries, whose leftover seeds become the ammunition for the attacks it fires off from its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"きのみが 餌。 喰らった後の タネを 弾として 口から 発射し 攻撃に 利用。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On peut deviner son état d’esprit et de santé en étudiant le rythme auquel il tape contre les arbres avec son bec dur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Agujerea los árboles con su robusto pico. Al oír su picoteo, uno puede deducir más o menos su humor o su estado de forma."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It pecks at trees with its hard beak. You can get some idea of its mood or condition from the rhythm of its pecking."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"硬いクチバシで 樹木を つつく。 つつくリズムで そのときの 機嫌や 体調も なんとなく わかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son cou fin renferme des muscles étonnamment puissants. Il tape contre les arbres à raison de seize coups de bec par seconde."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pese a su fino aspecto, tiene la musculatura del cuello muy desarrollada: agujerea los árboles a una velocidad de 16 picotazos por segundo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It may look spindly, but its neck muscles are heavy-duty. It can peck at a tree 16 times per second!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"細く 見えるが 強靭な 首の 筋肉を持つ。 秒間 １６連打で 木を 突きまくるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":731,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[25,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[25,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"drill-peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",27],[18,"level-up",27],[25,"level-up",27]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mirror-move","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"sky-attack","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swagger","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"m